{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/b25d0bab9c704fe6e1dcd60535b717dc.avif?t=1772307865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras_big/b25d0bab9c704fe6e1dcd60535b717dc.webp?t=1772307865 width=1560 height=336 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner:</strong> Blend into the environment, build your escape, and survive the timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catcher:</strong> Hunt down all Runners before time\u2019s up. Watch as structures decay and the map reveals their secrets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/1a48f75b7fd1db66651632ad3315e813.poster.avif?t=1772307865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/1a48f75b7fd1db66651632ad3315e813.webm?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/1a48f75b7fd1db66651632ad3315e813.mp4?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/df168a33fa35ab78d6d60ef2c4f658b1.avif?t=1772307865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras_big/df168a33fa35ab78d6d60ef2c4f658b1.webp?t=1772307865 width=1560 height=334 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into your surroundings by transforming into almost any object. Outwit your enemies with perfect disguises and unexpected movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.poster.avif?t=1772307865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.webm?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.mp4?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/91f41018cae4df294a2ffbb9fe5b30e3.avif?t=1772307865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras_big/91f41018cae4df294a2ffbb9fe5b30e3.webp?t=1772307865 width=1560 height=334 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special orbs across the map to gain temporary abilities. Stun enemies, teleport, reveal hidden players, or sabotage builds \u2014 the chaos is yours to control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.poster.avif?t=1772307865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.webm?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.mp4?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/82866ef6a2570beafc0069e5bdb6bc1b.avif?t=1772307865\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras_big/82866ef6a2570beafc0069e5bdb6bc1b.webp?t=1772307865 width=1560 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full SeekOut thrill anytime with our <strong>integrated Bot System</strong>. These aren't just standing targets\u2014our Smart Bots are designed to mimic player behavior, helping you master complex mechanics like trap placement and prop morphing in a low-pressure environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e2b4c31eb317c363976491165a566dd8.poster.avif?t=1772307865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e2b4c31eb317c363976491165a566dd8.webm?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e2b4c31eb317c363976491165a566dd8.mp4?t=1772307865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Seek Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Multiplayer chaos where players become props or hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Building</strong> \u2013 Use simple structures to change the flow of every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power orbs keep matches unpredictable and wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Style your character with unlockable outfits, effects, and emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Maps</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and strategic hiding spots in handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Fun</strong> \u2013 No match is ever the same, thanks to player creativity and dynamic tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports 2\u201315 Players</strong> \u2013 Ideal for parties, streams, or competitive hide-and-seek lovers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1772307865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1772307865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/80b01f818417ba7a5088d0cf00dfec34a5454cf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772307865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/80b01f818417ba7a5088d0cf00dfec34a5454cf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772307865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=