 of every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power orbs keep matches unpredictable and wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Style your character with unlockable outfits, effects, and emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Maps</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and strategic hiding spots in handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Fun</strong> \u2013 No match is ever the same, thanks to player creativity and dynamic tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports 2\u201315 Players</strong> \u2013 Ideal for parties, streams, or competitive hide-and-seek lovers.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nightroot Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/e03ebe7e9201646a4d5964d99a36b719283ec983/header.jpg?t=1772307865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768140/1598228852/e71d6aa308fbb7f8a61b8ce85c8f52f4758d5928/1770297296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770302684","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768140/1598228852/e71d6aa308fbb7f8a61b8ce85c8f52f4758d5928/1770297296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770302684","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3768140/1598228852/e71d6aa308fbb7f8a61b8ce85c8f52f4758d5928/1770297296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770302684","id":257255216,"name":"Tra